DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260305T150000
UID:1dfb4f2541ac477955d3d6d2@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Jnanavaca and Maitreyabandhu have been creating these signific
 ant retreats for a few years now. They have a strong dharmic vision: a vig
 orous exploration of deep dharma principles\, coupled with intensive medit
 ation input and a strongly devotional approach.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mens-intensive-long-week
 end-2026
