 class-2026-03-08
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transforming Self & World
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260308T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260308T123000
UID:61e737ee90ecb745193946d1@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:How does a committed spiritual life actually transform the wor
 ld? Facing death from cancer\, Devamitra reflects on the impact of 50 year
 s of Buddhist practice\, his service to Bhante's vision\, and his inspirat
 ion from the burning monk\, Thich Quan Duc.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/transforming-self-world-
 2026-03-08
END:VEVENT
